      "content": "wait, \"cat bug\"? i've never heard of that one. and what's a \"fungus-gna moth\"? i thought fungus gnats were just little flies that live in the soil. are these pests actually that hard to spot? it just feels like there's something small and elusive constantly sneaking around the plants when i'm not looking.",
